Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.26,0:31:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, haa..
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.31,0:31:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, haa..
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.39,0:31:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, haa..
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.65,0:32:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dancing to the sun's rhythm, we dance and sing "Ole"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.78,0:32:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Different rhythmic stomps join together in unison
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.91,0:32:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's got things they love and things they don't
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.04,0:32:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No two people in the world are exactly alike, turning like the colors in a kaleidoscope
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.68,0:32:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.89,0:32:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and feel, feel, feel the energy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.97,0:32:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make a move
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.97,0:32:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Give into the impulse and clap, clap, clap your hands
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.98,0:32:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,one, two, three
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.81,0:32:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Step, step, step let it resonate
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.77,0:32:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our miracle is just beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.40,0:32:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams and aspirations are one in the same
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.74,0:32:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,giving birth to a neww dream
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.83,0:33:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Dance to your heart's content, chicas
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.29,0:33:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Our future is right around the corner
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.71,0:33:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now no one knows
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.17,0:33:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the sound of a melody yet to be heard
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.93,0:33:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we dance together,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.64,0:33:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,we can bring to future to us
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.73,0:33:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, ah..
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.77,0:33:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bright and blinding, ah..
